## 📋 Architectural Plan: Customer Email Triage & Escalation Flow

### Summary

This flow triggers whenever a new email arrives in your inbox. A script node classifies the email as **urgent** or **normal** based on keywords in the subject and body (e.g., "urgent", "ASAP", "critical", "outage"). Urgent emails are immediately escalated — a Slack alert is posted to your support team channel and an acknowledgment reply is sent back to the customer. Normal emails are logged and marked as read. Both paths end gracefully.

---

### Flow Diagram

```mermaid
graph LR
    trigger(Email Received)
    classify[Classify Email Urgency]
    isUrgent{Urgent}
    slackAlert[Slack Alert to Team]
    replyCustomer[Reply to Customer]
    markRead[Mark Email Read]
    errorHandler[Log Error]
    doneUrgent(Done Escalated)
    doneNormal(Done Normal)
    doneError(Done Error)
    trigger -->|output| classify
    classify -->|success| isUrgent
    classify -->|error| errorHandler
    isUrgent -->|true| slackAlert
    isUrgent -->|false| markRead
    slackAlert -->|output| replyCustomer
    slackAlert -->|error| errorHandler
    replyCustomer -->|output| doneUrgent
    markRead -->|output| doneNormal
    errorHandler -->|success| doneError
```

---

### Node Table

| # | Node ID | Name | Category | Node Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | `trigger` | Email Received | trigger | `uipath.connector.trigger.uipath-mock-outlook.email-received` | Fires on every new inbox email |
| 2 | `classify` | Classify Email Urgency | action | `core.action.script` | Checks subject + body for urgency keywords; returns `{ isUrgent, reason, subject, sender }` |
| 3 | `isUrgent` | Urgent? | control | `core.logic.decision` | Branches on `$vars.classify.output.isUrgent === true` |
| 4 | `slackAlert` | Slack Alert to Team | action | `uipath.connector.uipath-salesforce-slack.send-message-to-channel` | Posts a structured alert to your support Slack channel |
| 5 | `replyCustomer` | Reply to Customer | action | `uipath.connector.uipath-mock-outlook.reply-to-email` | Sends an acknowledgment back to the sender |
| 6 | `markRead` | Mark Email Read | action | `uipath.connector.uipath-mock-outlook.mark-email-read-or-unread` | Marks non-urgent email as read |
| 7 | `errorHandler` | Log Error | action | `core.action.script` | Logs the error message; safe landing for any node fault |
| 8 | `doneUrgent` | Done Escalated | control | `core.control.end` | Terminal node for the escalation path |
| 9 | `doneNormal` | Done Normal | control | `core.control.end` | Terminal node for the normal path |
| 10 | `doneError` | Done Error | control | `core.control.end` | Terminal node for the error path |

